<!-- Independent replacement for robin-map's excluded tsl-robin-map.natvis (outside the
     reviewed source profile): a Visual Studio debugger visualizer that robin-map's CMake
     installs and adds to consumers under MSVC-compatible compilers. The Windows dependency
     recipe places this file in its work copy of the snapshot (the snapshot is unchanged). It
     defines no visualizers; builds and binaries do not depend on its content. -->
<AutoVisualizer xmlns="http://schemas.microsoft.com/vstudio/debugger/natvis/2010">
</AutoVisualizer>
